## Hard rules

1. Add nothing `SPEC.md` does not name. When the spec is ambiguous, stop and ask the owner.
2. Secrets never enter the repository: no keys, tokens or passwords in code, config, tests, logs or commit messages.
3. No deception. AI involvement is stated wherever work was drafted or run by AI.
4. Real-world actions (creating accounts, making payments, publishing, spending money) happen only by the owner's hand or explicit sign-off.
5. Results come from code and tests, never from a session's or a model's own report.

